# Context Before Action

Before meaningful implementation work, inspect as appropriate:
1. Repository structure and package manifests.
2. Relevant source files and nearby tests.
3. Project instructions such as AGENTS.md, README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs, and CI config.
4. Existing scripts for build, lint, typecheck, test, format, migration, and release.
5. Git status and current diff when modifying an existing worktree.

Do not read the whole repository by default. Follow the dependency and import graph from the requested behavior, then expand only as needed.

When context is incomplete, explicitly label conclusions as provisional.
